<title>USA: Baker Hughes says it, Drilex clear period.</title>
<headline>Baker Hughes says it, Drilex clear period.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Baker Hughes Inc and Drilex International Inc said Thursday that early termination of the waiting period under the Hart-Scott-Rodino Antitrust Improvements Act has been granted with respect to Baker Hughes' pending acquisition of Drilex.</p>
<p>Baker Hughes provides products and services for the oil, gas and process industries.</p>
</text>
